msgctxt "248"
msgid "(The phone's ringing. It's probably that same guy.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "(I don't want to get involved.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "(It's probably the guy from before.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "(The phone's ringing. It's probably that same guy.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "(Picking up would be asking for trouble. Not my problem.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"(Nobody picked up this whole time. Whoever it was, he probably got the "
"hint.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid ""
"(Guess I'll pick it up. I wonder if I can figure out where he is from the "
"background noise?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"I see you bought the monogrammed bag. A man of such wealth must be used to "
"these luxuries..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"(There's some sort of sound in the background... I know I've heard that "
"before.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Now I want you to get 200,000 yen together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Bring the money, the necklace, and the bag to the parking lot behind the "
"Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"Immediately, if you please. If you don't show up, well... you know the "
"consequences, don't you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"(This background noise is a clue, at least. I think I've heard that at a "
"slots parlor somewhere in town...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"(I've got two choices: track down the caller, or bring 200,000 yen to the "
"parking lot behind the Millennium Tower.)"
msgstr ""

